Average Speed — The Trap Topic

##IMPORTANT

If someone travels equal distances at speeds S1 & S2 \
avg speed is NOT (S1+S2)/2.
its is Harmonic Mean:
                    [ Average speed = 2S1 * S2 / S1 + S2 ]

